{"id":"c8a5fc17e3cca479","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-dependency-pair-termination.md","title":"thm-dependency-pair-termination","display":"thm-dependency-pair-termination","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-dependency-pair-termination","aliases":["56-thm-dependency-pair-termination"],"display":"thm-dependency-pair-termination","type":"theorem","depends_on":["[[56-df-dependency-chain]]","[[56-df-terminating]]"],"source_section":"6.5.45","source_pages":"251","source_ocr_blocks":[272],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-contained-in-book; external-proof-not-read","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-dependency-pair-termination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-dependency-pair-termination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dependency-pair-termination"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a7c74fcead3e2ed\" href=\"?note=6a7c74fcead3e2ed\" title=\"56-df-dependency-chain\">56-df-dependency-chain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0c9e286170288bf\" href=\"?note=a0c9e286170288bf\" title=\"56-df-terminating\">56-df-terminating</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.5.45"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"251"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>272</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-contained-in-book; external-proof-not-read"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>；无限链采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6a7c74fcead3e2ed\" href=\"?note=6a7c74fcead3e2ed\" title=\"56-df-dependency-chain\">56-df-dependency-chain</a> 的完整定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\">\\(\\to_R\\)</span> 在原签名项集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R)\\iff\n\\neg\\mathrm{HasInfiniteChain}(\\Sigma,V,R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R)\\iff\n\\neg\\mathrm{HasInfiniteChain}(\\Sigma,V,R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 6.5.45。旧稿的“¬∃G”既未表达链也未表达终止，现修成实际定理。原书本小节明示只给方法概述、定理证明转引 Arts [1997] / Arts and Giesl [1997]；本次已核对陈述，未读取那些外引证明，因此不能报告“原书证明已核对”。定理不要求依赖图无环；图无环只是有限图情形下排除无限链的充分方法。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.5.45，印刷页 251。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本层提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-dependency-chain","status":"resolved","id":"6a7c74fcead3e2ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-dependency-chain]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terminating","status":"resolved","id":"a0c9e286170288bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terminating]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-dependency-chain","status":"resolved","id":"6a7c74fcead3e2ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$；无限链采用 [[56-df-dependency-chain]] 的完整定义，$\\to_R$ 在原签名项集 $T$ 上。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_R","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Terminating}(T,\\to_R)\\iff\n\\neg\\mathrm{HasInfiniteChain}(\\Sigma,V,R).","display":true}],"bytes":1472,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-237","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-dependency-pair-termination.md]]"}],"outgoing":["6a7c74fcead3e2ed","a0c9e286170288bf"]}